===Proper noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-pnoun}}

# ''Irish mythology.'' The lover of [[Midir]] whose rejected first wife [[Fuamnach]] became jealous and cast three spells on her, turning her into a pool of water, then into a worm, and then into a fly.

